- op: discuss  # 0361
  at: '2026-10-18T04:22:46Z'  # 0361
  by: agent  # 0361
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 0361
  clock: 3  # 0361
  nonce: '0361'  # 0361
  message: "Done in PR #1709 (dev df2aef43b5). discovery.exclude_cache_token digests the stripped, de-duplicated, sorted -e patterns into ex-<12 hex>; _get_results_cache_dir(repo_root, extra_excludes=...) suffixes the state segment with it like the trace-deps / channel / config tokens; run_survey writes under that key, the sketch command and _discover_or_survey read and auto-run under it; read commands (no --exclude) keep the plain key, so an excluding survey is never what they find (the backend-flag rule). Behavioral evidence: test_results_cache_excludes_key.py re-runs the filed scenario in-process (survey repo; survey repo -e lib; read-path discovery) — red: the plain survey was replaced and 'lo' was gone; green: the plain survey still holds hi and lo, the excluding one lives under its own key with hi only."  # 0361
